                                "sense_id": "bd3b8bcf-2f59-3f77-9da2-9cc0ff160ecd",
                                "text": "Он, быва́ло, подо́лгу си́живал с на́ми",
                                "translation": "He used to sit with us for hours",
                                "english": "He used to sit with us for hours"
